The Rovaniemi Football Club, which plays in the men's football league, has signed Estonian striker Albert Prosa to the end of the season.
We are looking for a top player for our team who has power and whose threshold to come to Finland and Rovaniemi is small.
We went through more than 50 players from all over the world with more than ten player agents.
Little by little, Prosa began to stand out from the crowd as a good alternative, RoPS coach Juha Malinen said in a press release.
