We offer a new future.
“Americanism, not globalism, is our creed,” Trump said.
Donald Trump's America doesn't need to change the world:
American cars will drive through the streets, American planes to connect cities, American ships to control the oceans, American steel to raise new skyscrapers all over the country.
Unlike usual, Trump faithfully read a speech written by aides, despite the fact that well-organised protests interrupted it 14 times.
